# cx-audit: the plan screen's stick, leaving, stopping, and what the shelf says after.
#seed family.json
wait S1
press a
wait M1
press a
wait M3
press coin
wait M4
say I want a game where a penguin catches fish that fall from the sky
hold a 300
wait M6
# Add more.
press down
press down
shot M6-add-more-lit
press a
wait say idle
shot M4-add-more-mic
say and a boot falls sometimes
hold y 300
wait M6
shot M6-added
press a
wait M7
# ESC on a question asks; ESC again goes back to the question.
press esc
wait E8
press esc
wait M7
shot M7-esc-on-E8-goes-back
press right
press left
press a
wait question
press a
wait question
press a
wait M9
shot M9-plan
# The two tiles sit side by side. Right is the reader, not "Change it".
press right
wait reader
shot M9-right-opens-reader
press left
wait M9
press down
shot M9-down-lights-change
press left
shot M9-left-lights-build
press down
press a
wait say idle
shot M9-change-it-mic
press esc
wait M9
# Stop.
press esc
wait E8
press down
press down
press a
wait E13
shot E13-are-you-sure
press esc
wait M9
press esc
wait E8
press down
press down
press a
wait E13
press up
press a
wait S1
shot S1-after-stop
sleep 1500
shot S1-after-stop-later
press a
sleep 800
shot make-after-stop
press esc
sleep 500
shot after-esc
